# Build context = the repository root; only what the package reads (allowlist): pqz-core/, the PQZ vectors and
# pqz_kat.py (pqzh/xcheck/kat_stmt.py, stmt/xcheck.py), the PQZH EVM fixtures (the Ligero crate's evm_fixtures test)
*
!pqz-core
!smartcontracts/vectors/pqz
!smartcontracts/evm/test/vectors/pqzh-ligero
pqz-core/build
pqz-core/artifact/out
pqz-core/xcheck/static/raw-*
pqz-core/xcheck/static/results-*.json
**/target
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.wasm
